OL,3,GNEWSAThe tiny wetlands playing a       
OL,4,Agrowing role in the fight against      
OL,5,ASevern flooding                        
OL,7,FTiny wetlands scattered across the     
OL,8,FShropshire countryside are playing a   
OL,9,Fgrowing role in the fight against      
OL,10,Fflooding, with landowners helping to   
OL,11,Fslow rainwater before it reaches the   
OL,12,FRiver Severn.                          
OL,14,FCommunities across Shropshire and      
OL,15,FWorcestershire have repeatedly seen    
OL,16,Fhomes flooded, roads closed and flood  
OL,17,Fbarriers deployed when the river bursts
OL,18,Fits banks after periods of heavy rain. 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
