OL,3,GNEWSAThe tiny wetlands playing a       
OL,4,Agrowing role in the fight against      
OL,5,ASevern flooding                        
OL,7,FNow, landowners are backing a programme
OL,8,Fof wetlands, ponds and "leaky dams"    
OL,9,Fdesigned to hold water higher up the   
OL,10,Fcatchment and reduce pressure on towns 
OL,11,Fand villages further downstream.       
OL,13,FA project in the Gatton Valley,        
OL,14,FShropshire, has already led to the     
OL,15,Fcreation of about 60 wetlands aimed at 
OL,16,Fstoring rainwater before it reaches    
OL,17,Frivers and streams feeding into the    
OL,18,FSevern.                                
